able without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lightkeeper\u2019s Curse is a horror puzzle game where you explore a dark, cursed castle using limited light orbs to keep a deadly monster at bay. Solve environmental puzzles, manage your light carefully, and stay out of the shadows...or die in them.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging puzzles:\u00a0</strong>Solve interconnected environmental puzzles that test logic and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive atmosphere and sound design:\u00a0</strong>Dynamic audio and visual cues create a tense, haunting environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light-based survival mechanics:\u00a0</strong>Use limited light orbs to repel darkness and stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating story:\u00a0</strong>Uncover the castle\u2019s tragic past through exploration and hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A focused yet fulfilling experience (2\u20133 hours):\u00a0</strong>Designed for one or two sittings with no filler content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a Dark History</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the era of Dark Alchemists that once inhabited the ruins of Gloamspire Keep, a group of alchemists, filled with hubris and blinded by their own lust for power, sought to create a powerful being that would protect their walls and instill fear in their enemies both near and far.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http